IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-MERGE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 RANK-R              PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MERGED-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 OVERLAP-PCT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LORA-MERGE.
    IF RANK-R == 0 OR HIDDEN-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 2 TO MERGED-COUNT.
    MOVE 84 TO OVERLAP-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 MERGED-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 OVERLAP-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
